Nova Studio @NOVA_DISPLAY_VERSION@ (preview)
==========================================

Nova Studio is a native Windows editor for Minecraft Java Edition resource packs: textures,
animations, models and UVs, with a managed test runtime for Minecraft Java Edition 1.21.11.

This is a PREVIEW release. Keep backups of resource packs you care about.

NOT AN OFFICIAL MINECRAFT PRODUCT. NOT APPROVED BY OR ASSOCIATED WITH MOJANG OR MICROSOFT.
Nova Studio is developed and published by the Nova Studio contributors, who are solely
responsible for it. "Minecraft" is a trademark of Mojang AB and Microsoft Corporation.
Nova Studio contains no Minecraft game assets.

Requirements
  * Windows 11, 64-bit (x64). Other Windows versions are not tested.
  * A graphics driver with OpenGL 2.1 or later.
  * No administrator rights. Nova Studio installs and runs for your Windows account only.

Start here
  * Open Nova Studio from the Start menu.
  * Open a resource pack folder (File > Open Resource Pack) or create one.
  * Press Ctrl+K to search for any command, tool, setting, workspace or texture.
  * docs\FIRST_RUN.md walks through a first session.

AI agents (MCP)
  * nova-mcp.exe in this folder lets an AI agent such as Claude Desktop, Claude Code or Codex
    work with the open resource pack. Set it up in Resources > MCP Integration > Agent Setup.
  * Agents get no access until you choose Allow on the Access tab, for one session and one
    project at a time. See docs\MCP_SETUP.md.

Your data
  * Resource packs stay where you keep them. Settings, recovery snapshots and the Minecraft test
    runtime are in %LOCALAPPDATA%\Nova Studio. Upgrading or uninstalling never removes them.

