    (revision @NOVA_GIT_REVISION@). docs\BUILDING.md explains how to build it.
  * licenses\qtbase-everywhere-src-6.12.0.tar.xz is the source of the Qt libraries. You may
    replace the Qt DLLs with your own build of Qt 6.12.0.

